**3.3  AFI Record  (data-afi.json → afis[])**

AFIs are first-class objects with a full lifecycle. An AFI is not a text note — it is a structured record with linked evidence.

| **afiId** | String. UUID. |
| --- | --- |
| **areaCode** | String. The area this AFI belongs to. |
| **staffId** | String or null. If this AFI relates to a specific staff member. |
| **lraCategoryId** | String. References LRA category. e.g. CAT1, CAT6. |
| **lraThemeId** | String. References LRA theme. e.g. CU (Checks for Understanding). |
| **lraThemeLabel** | String. Human-readable theme label for display. |
| **description** | String. Plain language description of the TLA gap. |
| **digitalOpportunity** | String or null. Where digital could support this, if appropriate. Not mandatory. |
| **digitalApplicable** | Boolean. True if digital is relevant. False is a valid recorded outcome. |
| **rationaleTest** | String or null. If teacher has non-digital response — is it working? |
| **status** | enum: open │ actioned │ impact-checked │ closed │ re-opened. |
| **severity** | enum: strength │ develop │ immediate. Maps to LRA language. |
| **closeWindow** | String. Expected evidence horizon. e.g. "2-weeks", "6-weeks". Reflects complexity of change. |
| **linkedActions** | Array of ActionEntry objects — see 3.3a. |
| **evidenceChain** | Array of EvidenceEntry objects — see 3.3b. |
| **parentObservationId** | String or null. DevObs or LW that generated this AFI. |
| **hyperThemeMatch** | String or null. If this maps to one of the three Hyper focus areas: accessible-by-design │ digital-learning-environment │ assistive-technology. |
| **qipRef** | String or null. QIP reference code if this feeds a QIP action. |
| **createdAt** | ISO timestamp. |
| **closedAt** | ISO timestamp or null. |
| **lastUpdated** | ISO timestamp. |

