| **js/config.js** | Configuration constants. Password hash, Supabase URL, Supabase anon key (Hub Lite read), GitHub API endpoint for CPD Library. NO secrets that grant write access to sensitive data. |
| **js/data.js** | Data layer. All read/write operations to OneDrive JSON files. File System Access API logic. Manifest loading. Auto-save scheduler. Session snapshot to localStorage. No UI logic. |
| **js/schema.js** | Schema constants. LRA_TAXONOMY hardcoded object. AFI_SEVERITY enum. HYPER_FOCUS array. AREA_CODES list. No UI logic. No data operations. |
| **js/app.js** | Application controller. Tab routing. Module initialisation. Event delegation. Imports from data.js and schema.js only. |
| **js/homepage.js** | Homepage module. Jobs Board (post-its), upcoming deadlines, upcoming meetings. Reads from data-calendar.json and data-afi.json. |
| **js/areas.js** | Areas module. 35-area overview. Area detail view. RAG matrix display. Area activity log. |
