| **js/devobs.js** | Development Observation modal. LRA category/theme selection with heuristic follow-up questions. Hyper theme tagging. AFI auto-draft on save. Dual-write to activityLog and afiRecords. |
| **js/learningwalk.js** | Learning Walk module. Quick capture with LRA theme tagging. Hyper focus areas prominent. Option to escalate to DevObs. |
| **js/afi.js** | AFI lifecycle module. Status transitions. Evidence chain display. Action selection panel. Loop open/close logic. |
| **js/templates.js** | Template Library module. Teach Meet plan builder (Six Stages structure). Coaching Question sets (LRA-themed, AI-drafted flagged, DPC approval). Meeting agenda templates. Versioning. Instance creation. |
| **js/staff.js** | Staff Profile module. Dynamic creation. Touch history. Reflection timeline. Development priorities. ETF stage. |
| **js/healthcheck.js** | Health Check module. Upload ingestion (Forms Excel / Moodle format). AI extraction via Anthropic API (Haiku). DPC review and confirm/overwrite. Score write to area record. |
| **js/reflections.js** | Reflection module. Event-linked reflection forms. Immediate and follow-up prompts. Anonymous aggregation at area level. AFI evidence wiring. |
| **js/calendar.js** | Shadow calendar module. Week/Month/Year views. Task/meeting/work-block creation. Micro-tasks. Deadline tracking. Jobs Board data source. |
