| **js/cpd.js** | CPD module. DPC personal CPD log. Planned training. CPD delivered to individuals and areas. |
| **js/current-focus.js** | Current Focus module. Flexible targeted focus objects. What/Why/How/Who/Impact. |
| **js/reports.js** | Report Builder module. Five audience templates. Word doc generation via docx library (loaded from CDN). AI narrative for performance review. |
| **js/dashboard.js** | Dashboards module. Area RAG filterable dashboard. Health Check multi-level dashboard (collegiate, area, quality, PLS/Executive/Leadership/Areas). |
| **js/ai-support.js** | AI Support module. Strengths synthesis. Risk/AFI surfacing. Action plan generation. Report narrative. Anthropic API calls. |
| **js/notes.js** | Notes module. Quick note taking. Link to meetings, people, projects. |
