- js/digital-leads.js — DL profiles, 1:1 meeting records, resources created, progress, impact evidence

- js/current-focus.js — flexible focus objects, What/Why/How/Who/Impact, linked AFIs and areas, SEND as first entry

- js/dashboard.js — Area RAG filterable dashboard, Health Check multi-level dashboard

- js/reports.js — five audience Word doc templates, AI narrative for performance review (Anthropic Sonnet)

- js/cpd.js — DPC personal CPD log, planned training, CPD delivered records

- js/notes.js — quick notes, linkable to meetings/people/projects

**Done-criteria**

- Health Check Excel upload processed, AI extraction produces provisional scores for each dimension

- DPC can confirm or overwrite each score with rationale

- Confirmed scores write to area Health Check record

- Area RAG dashboard shows all 35 areas, filterable by dimension, score, AFI status, next action needed

- Health Check dashboard shows collegiate, area, quality views with hierarchical breakdown

- All five report templates generate valid Word documents

- Performance review report includes AI narrative section (Anthropic Sonnet API)

